  "id": "506ff04c13ef684ec4ef3661",
  "title": "Android Service：开发自己的通知中心(1):辅助性服务介绍",
  "summary": "1 辅助性服务介绍 2026-10-13 更新：本文原写于 2014 年，介绍 Android 4.0（API 14）起的无障碍服务配置。无障碍服务本身仍然有效，但用它实现通用通知中心的路线已过时；Android 4.3（API 18）起应使用专门的 NotificationListenerService 。下文修正服务声明和示例，并补充 Android 13（API 33）的节点回收变化。 辅助性服务（现通常称无障碍服务）用于帮助残障用户或暂时无法正常操作设备的用户使用应用，例如将界面文本读出来，或者提供触觉反馈。这一节介绍如何创建服务、接收界面事件和查询节点信息。 AccessibilityService 由系统在用户授权后绑定，不能当作普通后台任务服务来启动。下面给出服务骨架和几个方法的写法；接进自己的…",
  "content": "<h1><a title=\"1 辅助性服务介绍\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"></a>1 辅助性服务介绍</h1><blockquote><p>2026-10-13 更新：本文原写于 2014 年，介绍 Android 4.0（API 14）起的无障碍服务配置。无障碍服务本身仍然有效，但用它实现通用通知中心的路线已过时；Android 4.3（API 18）起应使用专门的 <a href=\"https://developer.android.com/reference/android/service/notification/NotificationListenerService\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">NotificationListenerService</a>。下文修正服务声明和示例，并补充 Android 13（API 33）的节点回收变化。</p></blockquote><p>辅助性服务（现通常称无障碍服务）用于帮助残障用户或暂时无法正常操作设备的用户使用应用，例如将界面文本读出来，或者提供触觉反馈。这一节介绍如何创建服务、接收界面事件和查询节点信息。</p><p><code>AccessibilityService</code> 由系统在用户授权后绑定，不能当作普通后台任务服务来启动。下面给出服务骨架和几个方法的写法；接进自己的应用时，还需要补上语音引擎、设置界面和应用资源。<a href=\"https://developer.android.com/reference/android/accessibilityservice/AccessibilityService\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">服务生命周期与配置</a></p><span></span><h1><a title=\"2 创建自己的辅助性服务\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"></a>2 创建自己的辅助性服务</h1><h2><a title=\"2.1 继承 AccessibilityService\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"></a>2.1 继承 AccessibilityService</h2><p>一个辅助性服务可以放在现有应用中，也可以作为独立应用提供。在工程中创建继承 <code>AccessibilityService</code> 的类，并实现两个必要回调：</p><figure><table><tr><td><pre><span>1</span><br><span>2</span><br><span>3</span><br><span>4</span><br><span>5</span><br><span>6</span><br><span>7</span><br><span>8</span><br><span>9</span><br><span>10</span><br><span>11</span><br><span>12</span><br><span>13</span><br></pre></td><td><pre><span><span>import</span> android.accessibilityservice.AccessibilityService;</span><br><span><span>import</span> android.view.accessibility.AccessibilityEvent;</span><br><span></span><br><span><span>public</span> <span>class</span> <span>MyAccessibilityService</span> <span>extends</span> <span>AccessibilityService</span> {</span><br><span>    <span>@Override</span></span><br><span>    <span>public</span> <span>void</span> <span>onAccessibilityEvent</span><span>(AccessibilityEvent event)</span> {</span><br><span>    }</span><br><span></span><br><span>    <span>@Override</span></span><br><span>    <span>public</span> <span>void</span> <span>onInterrupt</span><span>()</span> {</span><br><span>        <span>// Stop any accessibility feedback currently being delivered.</span></span><br><span>    }</span><br><span>}</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><code>onAccessibilityEvent()</code> 接收匹配配置的事件；<code>onInterrupt()</code> 要求中断当前反馈，例如停止朗读，并不表示服务已经断开。</p><h2><a title=\"2.2 在 Manifest 中声明 service\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"></a>2.2 在 Manifest 中声明 service</h2><p>在 <code>AndroidManifest.xml</code> 的 <code>&lt;application&gt;</code> 内添加服务声明。<code>BIND_ACCESSIBILITY_SERVICE</code> 限制只有系统可以绑定；它写在服务的 <code>android:permission</code> 属性上。显式声明 <code>android:exported</code> 也满足 Android 12（targetSdk 31）起<a href=\"https://developer.android.com/about/versions/12/behavior-changes-12#exported\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">带 intent filter 的组件要求</a>。</p><figure><table><tr><td><pre><span>1</span><br><span>2</span><br><span>3</span><br><span>4</span><br><span>5</span><br><span>6</span><br><span>7</span><br><span>8</span><br><span>9</span><br></pre></td><td><pre><span><span>&lt;!-- Inside the existing &lt;application&gt; element. --&gt;</span></span><br><span><span>&lt;<span>service</span></span></span><br><span><span>     <span>android:name</span>=<span>&quot;.MyAccessibilityService&quot;</span></span></span><br><span><span>     <span>android:permission</span>=<span>&quot;android.permission.BIND_ACCESSIBILITY_SERVICE&quot;</span></span></span><br><span><span>     <span>android:exported</span>=<span>&quot;true&quot;</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span>     <span>&lt;<span>intent-filter</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span>         <span>&lt;<span>action</span> <span>android:name</span>=<span>&quot;android.accessibilityservice.AccessibilityService&quot;</span> /&gt;</span></span><br><span>     <span>&lt;/<span>intent-filter</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span><span>&lt;/<span>service</span>&gt;</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>系统通过这个 action 识别无障碍服务，事件类型由下一节的配置控制。完整声明还需要加上指向 XML 的元数据。</p><h2><a title=\"2.3 配置 service\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"></a>2.3 配置 service</h2><p>服务可以不提供启动 Activity；如果需要说明授权用途或提供设置，可以保留 Activity。接下来要配置的是：响应哪些事件？对所有应用生效，还是只处理指定的包？采用什么反馈？这些由 <code>AccessibilityServiceInfo</code> 控制。</p><p>运行时调整配置可以使用 <code>setServiceInfo()</code>。下面的方法放入服务类，并导入 <code>android.accessibilityservice.AccessibilityServiceInfo</code>；从已有配置开始修改，保留 XML 中的其他设置：</p><figure><table><tr><td><pre><span>1</span><br><span>2</span><br><span>3</span><br><span>4</span><br><span>5</span><br><span>6</span><br><span>7</span><br><span>8</span><br><span>9</span><br><span>10</span><br><span>11</span><br><span>12</span><br><span>13</span><br><span>14</span><br><span>15</span><br><span>16</span><br></pre></td><td><pre><span></span><br><span><span>@Override</span></span><br><span><span>protected</span> <span>void</span> <span>onServiceConnected</span><span>()</span> {</span><br><span>    <span>AccessibilityServiceInfo</span> <span>info</span> <span>=</span> getServiceInfo();</span><br><span>    <span>if</span> (info == <span>null</span>) {</span><br><span>        <span>return</span>;</span><br><span>    }</span><br><span>    info.eventTypes = AccessibilityEvent.TYPE_VIEW_CLICKED |</span><br><span>            AccessibilityEvent.TYPE_VIEW_FOCUSED;</span><br><span>    info.packageNames = <span>new</span> <span>String</span>[]</span><br><span>            {<span>&quot;com.example.android.myFirstApp&quot;</span>, <span>&quot;com.example.android.mySecondApp&quot;</span>};</span><br><span>    info.feedbackType = AccessibilityServiceInfo.FEEDBACK_SPOKEN;</span><br><span>    info.flags = AccessibilityServiceInfo.DEFAULT;</span><br><span>    info.notificationTimeout = <span>100</span>;</span><br><span>    <span>this</span>.setServiceInfo(info);</span><br><span>}</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>这里的包名只是示例，要换成需要辅助的应用。<code>notificationTimeout</code> 是事件通知的节流间隔，单位为毫秒，不是服务存活时间。</p><p>Android 4.0（API 14）起也可以在 <code>res/xml/serviceconfig.xml</code> 中配置服务；<code>canRetrieveWindowContent</code> 这类能力需要通过 XML 声明。与上面事件范围对应的配置如下：</p><figure><table><tr><td><pre><span>1</span><br><span>2</span><br><span>3</span><br><span>4</span><br><span>5</span><br><span>6</span><br><span>7</span><br></pre></td><td><pre><span><span>&lt;<span>accessibility-service</span> <span>xmlns:android</span>=<span>&quot;http://schemas.android.com/apk/res/android&quot;</span></span></span><br><span><span>     <span>android:accessibilityEventTypes</span>=<span>&quot;typeViewClicked|typeViewFocused&quot;</span></span></span><br><span><span>     <span>android:packageNames</span>=<span>&quot;com.example.android.myFirstApp, com.example.android.mySecondApp&quot;</span></span></span><br><span><span>     <span>android:accessibilityFeedbackType</span>=<span>&quot;feedbackSpoken&quot;</span></span></span><br><span><span>     <span>android:notificationTimeout</span>=<span>&quot;100&quot;</span></span></span><br><span><span>     <span>android:canRetrieveWindowContent</span>=<span>&quot;true&quot;</span></span></span><br><span><span>/&gt;</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><code>feedbackSpoken</code> 声明反馈类型，不会自动实现朗读。若提供 <code>settingsActivity</code>，必须指向项目中实际存在且已声明的 Activity。</p><p>使用 XML 配置时，把上一节的服务声明补全为下面的形式：</p><figure><table><tr><td><pre><span>1</span><br><span>2</span><br><span>3</span><br><span>4</span><br><span>5</span><br><span>6</span><br><span>7</span><br><span>8</span><br><span>9</span><br><span>10</span><br></pre></td><td><pre><span><span>&lt;<span>service</span></span></span><br><span><span>     <span>android:name</span>=<span>&quot;.MyAccessibilityService&quot;</span></span></span><br><span><span>     <span>android:permission</span>=<span>&quot;android.permission.BIND_ACCESSIBILITY_SERVICE&quot;</span></span></span><br><span><span>     <span>android:exported</span>=<span>&quot;true&quot;</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span>     <span>&lt;<span>intent-filter</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span>         <span>&lt;<span>action</span> <span>android:name</span>=<span>&quot;android.accessibilityservice.AccessibilityService&quot;</span> /&gt;</span></span><br><span>     <span>&lt;/<span>intent-filter</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span>     <span>&lt;<span>meta-data</span> <span>android:name</span>=<span>&quot;android.accessibilityservice&quot;</span></span></span><br><span><span>     <span>android:resource</span>=<span>&quot;@xml/serviceconfig&quot;</span> /&gt;</span></span><br><span><span>&lt;/<span>service</span>&gt;</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>元数据的资源名必须与 XML 文件名一致。配置选项以 <a href=\"https://developer.android.com/reference/android/accessibilityservice/AccessibilityServiceInfo\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">AccessibilityServiceInfo</a> 为准。</p><h2><a title=\"2.4 响应 AccessibilityEvent 事件\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"></a>2.4 响应 AccessibilityEvent 事件</h2><p>在 <code>onAccessibilityEvent()</code> 中用 <code>getEventType()</code> 区分事件。以下节选读取内容描述；它可能为空，因此也检查事件携带的文本：</p><figure><table><tr><td><pre><span>1</span><br><span>2</span><br><span>3</span><br><span>4</span><br><span>5</span><br><span>6</span><br><span>7</span><br><span>8</span><br><span>9</span><br><span>10</span><br><span>11</span><br><span>12</span><br><span>13</span><br><span>14</span><br><span>15</span><br><span>16</span><br><span>17</span><br><span>18</span><br><span>19</span><br><span>20</span><br><span>21</span><br><span>22</span><br><span>23</span><br><span>24</span><br><span>25</span><br></pre></td><td><pre><span><span>@Override</span></span><br><span><span>public</span> <span>void</span> <span>onAccessibilityEvent</span><span>(AccessibilityEvent event)</span> {</span><br><span>    <span>final</span> <span>int</span> <span>eventType</span> <span>=</span> event.getEventType();</span><br><span>    String eventText;</span><br><span>    <span>switch</span>(eventType) {</span><br><span>        <span>case</span> AccessibilityEvent.TYPE_VIEW_CLICKED:</span><br><span>            eventText = <span>&quot;Clicked: &quot;</span>;</span><br><span>            <span>break</span>;</span><br><span>        <span>case</span> AccessibilityEvent.TYPE_VIEW_FOCUSED:</span><br><span>            eventText = <span>&quot;Focused: &quot;</span>;</span><br><span>            <span>break</span>;</span><br><span>        <span>default</span>:</span><br><span>            <span>return</span>;</span><br><span>    }</span><br><span></span><br><span>    <span>CharSequence</span> <span>label</span> <span>=</span> event.getContentDescription();</span><br><span>    <span>if</span> (label == <span>null</span> &amp;&amp; !event.getText().isEmpty()) {</span><br><span>        label = event.getText().get(<span>0</span>);</span><br><span>    }</span><br><span>    <span>if</span> (label == <span>null</span>) {</span><br><span>        <span>return</span>;</span><br><span>    }</span><br><span>    eventText = eventText + label;</span><br><span>    <span>// Pass eventText to the app&#x27;s initialized text-to-speech implementation.</span></span><br><span>}</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>这个回调运行在服务主线程上，耗时处理需要另外安排；注释处的语音反馈也需要处理初始化和中断。</p><p>需要更多上下文时，可以查询无障碍节点树。Android 4.0（API 14）起提供这项能力，需要在前面的 XML 中设置：</p><figure><table><tr><td><pre><span>1</span><br></pre></td><td><pre><span>android:canRetrieveWindowContent=&quot;true&quot;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><code>event.getSource()</code> 返回节点信息，也可能返回 <code>null</code>：事件类型、服务能力和节点是否仍然可用都会影响结果，不能只按窗口是否活动来判断。无障碍节点树也不保证与 View 层级一一对应。<a href=\"https://developer.android.com/reference/android/view/accessibility/AccessibilityRecord#getSource()\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">getSource() 文档</a></p><p>下面是替代前一个回调的节点处理示例，假定已知布局中，事件源的父节点有两个子节点：第一个是标签，第二个是复选框。真实应用要按其无障碍语义定位节点，不能对任意应用套用子节点下标。此节选需导入 <code>AccessibilityNodeInfo</code> 和 <code>android.os.Build</code>，使用 compileSdk 33 或更高版本：</p><figure><table><tr><td><pre><span>1</span><br><span>2</span><br><span>3</span><br><span>4</span><br><span>5</span><br><span>6</span><br><span>7</span><br><span>8</span><br><span>9</span><br><span>10</span><br><span>11</span><br><span>12</span><br><span>13</span><br><span>14</span><br><span>15</span><br><span>16</span><br><span>17</span><br><span>18</span><br><span>19</span><br><span>20</span><br><span>21</span><br><span>22</span><br><span>23</span><br><span>24</span><br><span>25</span><br><span>26</span><br><span>27</span><br><span>28</span><br><span>29</span><br><span>30</span><br><span>31</span><br><span>32</span><br></pre></td><td><pre><span><span>@Override</span></span><br><span><span>public</span> <span>void</span> <span>onAccessibilityEvent</span><span>(AccessibilityEvent event)</span> {</span><br><span>    <span>AccessibilityNodeInfo</span> <span>source</span> <span>=</span> event.getSource();</span><br><span>    <span>AccessibilityNodeInfo</span> <span>rowNode</span> <span>=</span> <span>null</span>;</span><br><span>    <span>AccessibilityNodeInfo</span> <span>labelNode</span> <span>=</span> <span>null</span>;</span><br><span>    <span>AccessibilityNodeInfo</span> <span>completeNode</span> <span>=</span> <span>null</span>;</span><br><span>    <span>try</span> {</span><br><span>        <span>if</span> (source == <span>null</span>) <span>return</span>;</span><br><span>        rowNode = source.getParent();</span><br><span>        <span>if</span> (rowNode == <span>null</span> || rowNode.getChildCount() &lt; <span>2</span>) <span>return</span>;</span><br><span>        labelNode = rowNode.getChild(<span>0</span>);</span><br><span>        completeNode = rowNode.getChild(<span>1</span>);</span><br><span>        <span>if</span> (labelNode == <span>null</span> || completeNode == <span>null</span></span><br><span>                || !completeNode.isCheckable()) <span>return</span>;</span><br><span>        <span>CharSequence</span> <span>label</span> <span>=</span> labelNode.getText();</span><br><span>        <span>if</span> (label == <span>null</span>) <span>return</span>;</span><br><span>        <span>String</span> <span>report</span> <span>=</span> label + (completeNode.isChecked() ? <span>&quot; (checked)&quot;</span> : <span>&quot; (not checked)&quot;</span>);</span><br><span>        <span>// Deliver report through the app&#x27;s feedback implementation.</span></span><br><span>    } <span>finally</span> {</span><br><span>        recycleBeforeAndroid13(completeNode);</span><br><span>        recycleBeforeAndroid13(labelNode);</span><br><span>        recycleBeforeAndroid13(rowNode);</span><br><span>        recycleBeforeAndroid13(source);</span><br><span>    }</span><br><span>}</span><br><span></span><br><span><span>@SuppressWarnings(&quot;deprecation&quot;)</span></span><br><span><span>private</span> <span>static</span> <span>void</span> <span>recycleBeforeAndroid13</span><span>(AccessibilityNodeInfo node)</span> {</span><br><span>    <span>if</span> (node != <span>null</span> &amp;&amp; Build.VERSION.SDK_INT &lt; Build.VERSION_CODES.TIRAMISU) {</span><br><span>        node.recycle();</span><br><span>    }</span><br><span>}</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>Android 13（API 33）取消了这类节点的对象池，<code>recycle()</code> 已废弃且不再起作用；兼容旧系统时，仍应在使用完获取的节点后回收。上面的 <code>finally</code> 保证提前返回时也处理节点。<a href=\"https://developer.android.com/reference/android/view/accessibility/AccessibilityNodeInfo#recycle()\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">AccessibilityNodeInfo.recycle()</a></p><p>安装后还需要用户到「设置 → 无障碍」启用服务。只有授权、目标包名和事件配置都满足条件，系统才会把匹配事件交给服务；注册 Manifest 不代表已经获得授权。</p><h1><a title=\"关于我 &amp;&amp; 博客\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"></a>关于我 &amp;&amp; 博客</h1><p>下面是个人的介绍和相关的链接，期望与同行的各位多多交流，三人行，则必有我师!</p><ol><li><a href=\"https://www.androidperformance.com/about/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">博主个人介绍</a> ：里面有个人的微信和微信群链接。</li><li><a href=\"https://androidperformance.com/2019/12/01/BlogMap/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">本博客内容导航</a> ：个人博客内容的一个导航。</li><li><a href=\"https://androidperformance.com/2018/05/07/Android-performance-optimization-skills-and-tools/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">个人整理和搜集的优秀博客文章 - Android 性能优化必知必会</a> ：欢迎大家自荐和推荐 （微信私聊即可）</li><li><a href=\"https://www.androidperformance.com/2023/12/30/the-performance/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Android性能优化知识星球</a>：付费社群已于 2026 年停止运营，不再招收新成员；此处保留历史介绍。</li></ol><blockquote><p><strong>一个人可以走的更快 , 一群人可以走的更远</strong></p></blockquote><p><img alt=\"微信扫一扫\"></p>",
